+issueNumber: MDL-89181
+notes:
+  core:
+    - message: >-
+        A new `\core\oauth2\server\client_manager` class has been added to
+        manage OAuth 2 server clients, their secrets and their redirect URIs
+        (fetching, updating, revoking, reactivating and deleting clients,
+        generating and revoking client secrets, and creating, removing and
+        validating redirect URIs). The class is expected to be obtained via
+        dependency injection (`\core\di::get(client_manager::class)`).
+        The `\core\oauth2\server\entity\client_entity` class now exposes the
+        client database ID via a new `get_id()` method.
+      type: added
